    "detailed_description": "<h1>\u2b50\ufe0fCARDS AND BADGES\u2b50\ufe0f</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849890/extras/497b9508659846973a3ac2ea82c83433.avif?t=1744983636\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849890/extras/6ff32690dbd847f2891b4c24d7410bd5.poster.avif?t=1744983636\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849890/extras/6ff32690dbd847f2891b4c24d7410bd5.webm?t=1744983636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849890/extras/6ff32690dbd847f2891b4c24d7410bd5.mp4?t=1744983636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Every neko girl loves cleanliness, wants to clean and take care of a master. And every certain maid has a secret \u2014 someone loves to be photographed in the master's mirror, the other loves to escape to the beach during a coffee break ... Solve all puzzles and find out all their secrets in the game Neko Maid! (^ \u2207 ^ *)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\u2764    Anime girls who have their own animation scenes<br></li><li>\u2764    Relaxing music<br></li><li>\u2764    CG Gallery Mode<br></li><li>\u2764    Puzzle game<br><br>Easy win:<br>Keyboard \u0421trl+D - Complete Level<br><br>In the game, your goal is to collect the puzzle in order to restore the pictures.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849890/extras/b73cfd25dbe7e97a0e500ac843265922.avif?t=1744983636\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849890/extras/d7f51758ef52870594016a2c98fcf04e.avif?t=1744983636\" /></div></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849890/extras/6ff32690dbd847f2891b4c24d7410bd5.poster.avif?t=1744983636\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849890/extras/6ff32690dbd847f2891b4c24d7410bd5.webm?t=1744983636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849890/extras/6ff32690dbd847f2891b4c24d7410bd5.mp4?t=1744983636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Every neko girl loves cleanliness, wants to clean and take care of a master. And every certain maid has a secret \u2014 someone loves to be photographed in the master's mirror, the other loves to escape to the beach during a coffee break ... Solve all puzzles and find out all their secrets in the game Neko Maid! (^ \u2207 ^ *)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\u2764    Anime girls who have their own animation scenes<br></li><li>\u2764    Relaxing music<br></li><li>\u2764    CG Gallery Mode<br></li><li>\u2764    Puzzle game<br><br>Easy win:<br>Keyboard \u0421trl+D - Complete Level<br><br>In the game, your goal is to collect the puzzle in order to restore the pictures.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849890/extras/b73cfd25dbe7e97a0e500ac843265922.avif?t=1744983636\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849890/extras/d7f51758ef52870594016a2c98fcf04e.avif?t=1744983636\" /></div></li></ul>",
